//RS /// carried by an authority overlay or by `package.jet` itself, so the overlay
//RS /// choice belongs to one place: the build staging loads this bundle first for
//RS /// the build-entry check, then again for the runtime program, and both loads
//RS /// must see the same bytes.
//RS fn load_build_entry_bundle(
